0	# InkOS — Sprint 1 Design Spec
1	
2	**From:** Vega (Design Agent)
3	**To:** Koda (Feature Builder)
4	**Date:** 2026-04-15
5	**Stack:** Stack A — Next.js 16.2.3, Tailwind 4, shadcn base-nova, dark-first
6	
7	---
8	
9	## 0. Mandatory Pre-Build Rules (Koda reads this before line 1 of code)
10	
11	1. `render` prop, NOT `asChild`. base-nova uses `@base-ui/react` primitives. Grep any component before wrapping with `asChild` — it will silently break.
12	2. Sidebar active state: CSS selector `[data-sidebar="menu-button"][data-active="true"]` in `globals.css`. NEVER `useSidebar()` ternaries in markup.
13	3. Active nav icon: `text-white` (NOT `text-primary` — purple on purple = invisible).
14	4. Collapsed sidebar styling: `group-data-[collapsible=icon]:*` classes only. No JS state for visual changes.
15	5. Shadows: `shadow-soft`, `shadow-card`, `shadow-soft-md` ONLY. `shadow-sm`/`shadow-md` = Sage hard-fail.
16	6. Tailwind opacity: `/8` is invalid. Use `/10` or `/[0.08]`.
17	7. All colors via CSS tokens. No raw hex except the two brand swatches already in `globals.css`.
18	8. `animationFillMode: "both"` on every staggered animation. Without it, cards flash at their final state before the animation starts.
19	9. Sidebar separators: gate with same condition as adjacent conditional element.
20	10. Duplicate nav: each destination appears in exactly ONE place (sidebar OR dropdown, never both).
21	
22	---
23	
24	## 1. Design Token Additions — `app/globals.css`
25	
26	Add to the `@theme inline` block (after existing tokens, before closing `}`):
27	
28	```css
29	@theme inline {
30	  /* existing tokens above... */
31	
32	  /* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
33	     SIDEBAR ICON-WIDTH for collapsed icon-only mode
34	  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
35	  --sidebar-width-icon: 3.5rem;
36	
37	  /* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
38	     STATUS BADGES — tattoo booking lifecycle
39	  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
40	  --color-status-pending: oklch(70% 0.16 72);       /* amber */
41	  --color-status-confirmed: oklch(62% 0.24 292);     /* purple (primary) */
42	  --color-status-in-progress: oklch(60% 0.2 200);    /* cyan */
43	  --color-status-completed: oklch(58% 0.18 145);     /* emerald */
44	  --color-status-cancelled: oklch(55% 0.02 264);     /* muted gray */
45	  --color-status-no-show: oklch(55% 0.22 27);        /* destructive red */
46	
47	  /* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
48	     NEON ACCENT — sparingly for alerts, pro badges, CTA emphasis
49	  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
50	  --color-neon-purple: oklch(72% 0.28 292);          /* brighter purple for highlights */
51	  --color-neon-purple-glow: 0 0 20px oklch(72% 0.28 292 / 0.4);
52	
53	  /* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
54	     ANIMATIONS
55	  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
56	  --animate-fade-in-up: fade-in-up 0.35s ease-out;
57	  --animate-fade-in: fade-in 0.2s ease-out;
58	  --animate-slide-in-right: slide-in-right 0.25s ease-out;
59	
60	  @keyframes fade-in-up {
61	    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
62	    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
63	  }
64	  @keyframes fade-in {
65	    from { opacity: 0; }
66	    to   { opacity: 1; }
67	  }
68	  @keyframes slide-in-right {
69	    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(8px); }
70	    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
71	  }
72	
73	  /* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
74	     ONBOARDING PROGRESS
75	  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
76	  --color-onboarding-track: oklch(22% 0.02 264);
77	  --color-onboarding-fill: oklch(62% 0.24 292);
78	}
79	```
80	
81	Add to `@layer components` (after existing `@layer base`):
82	
83	```css
84	@layer components {
85	  /* ── Sidebar active state (CSS selector, not JS state) ── */
86	  [data-sidebar="menu-button"][data-active="true"] {
87	    @apply bg-primary/10 text-primary-foreground;
88	    background-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.12);
89	    color: oklch(75% 0.18 292);
90	  }
91	  [data-sidebar="menu-button"][data-active="true"] svg {
92	    color: oklch(75% 0.18 292);
93	  }
94	  [data-sidebar="menu-button"][data-active="true"]:hover {
95	    background-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.18);
96	  }
97	
98	  /* ── Status badge variants ── */
99	  .badge-pending   { background-color: oklch(70% 0.16 72 / 0.12); color: oklch(70% 0.16 72); }
100	  .badge-confirmed { background-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.12); color: oklch(75% 0.18 292); }
101	  .badge-in-progress { background-color: oklch(60% 0.2 200 / 0.12); color: oklch(60% 0.2 200); }
102	  .badge-completed { background-color: oklch(58% 0.18 145 / 0.12); color: oklch(58% 0.18 145); }
103	  .badge-cancelled { background-color: oklch(55% 0.02 264 / 0.12); color: oklch(60% 0.02 264); }
104	  .badge-no-show   { background-color: oklch(55% 0.22 27 / 0.12); color: oklch(65% 0.2 27); }
105	
106	  /* ── KPI card subtle purple glow on hover (dashboard) ── */
107	  .kpi-card-hover {
108	    transition: box-shadow 150ms ease-out, transform 150ms ease-out;
109	  }
110	  .kpi-card-hover:hover {
111	    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft-md), 0 0 0 1px oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.15);
112	    transform: translateY(-1px);
113	  }
114	
115	  /* ── Onboarding step connector ── */
116	  .onboarding-step-active {
117	    background-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292);
118	    box-shadow: 0 0 12px oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.5);
119	  }

