# InkOS — Sprint 2 Design Spec: Booking Engine + Calendar

**From:** Vega (Design Agent)
**To:** Koda (Feature Builder)
**Date:** 2026-04-15
**Stack:** Stack A — Next.js 16.2.3, Tailwind 4, shadcn base-nova, dark-first
**Sprint:** 2 — Booking Engine + Calendar (Week 5–6)

---

## 0. Pre-Build Rules (Koda reads this before line 1)

Carry all 10 rules from Sprint 1 spec forward. New Sprint 2 additions:

11. Calendar library: **FullCalendar React** (`@fullcalendar/react` + `@fullcalendar/daygrid` + `@fullcalendar/timegrid` + `@fullcalendar/interaction`). See Section 1 for decision record.
12. Calendar drag-drop uses FullCalendar's `eventDrop` + `eventResize` callbacks. Update optimistically; roll back on API error with `toast.error`.
13. Appointment drawer is a `Sheet` (slide-in right), NOT a Dialog. It covers ~40% of the viewport at `xl`, full-width on mobile.
14. Public booking flow (`/book/[studioSlug]/**`) has zero InkOS chrome — no sidebar, no AppHeader. Isolated layout.
15. Public booking pages never import from `lib/supabase/server.ts` — only `lib/supabase/client.ts` or server actions using the service role for slot availability reads.
16. Status transitions are unidirectional (see Section 6). Never render a transition button that would create an illegal state.
17. `tabular-nums` class is mandatory on all time displays, date displays, and money values.
18. Appointment detail photo gallery: images fetched as Supabase signed URLs — never expose the raw storage path to the client.
19. New appointment drawer steps are wizard-scoped — use a local step state machine, NOT the URL (opening this drawer must not change the route).
20. Dodo deposit button in public booking is a `<button>` placeholder with `data-testid="deposit-cta"` — Sprint 4 wires the real checkout. Do NOT stub a fake form.

---

## 1. Calendar Library Decision Record

### Candidates evaluated

| Library | Bundle (gzipped) | Drag-drop | Time grid | TS support | License | Verdict |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **FullCalendar React** | ~58 KB | Native, polished | Yes (15/30/60 min slots) | Excellent | MIT (core) | **PICK** |
| react-big-calendar | ~32 KB | Via react-dnd | Yes | Adequate | MIT | Runner-up |
| Schedule-X | ~28 KB | Beta only | Yes | Good | MIT | Too new |
| Custom | ~0 KB | Manual | Manual | Perfect | — | Too costly |

### Why FullCalendar

1. **Drag-drop is production-grade** out of box — handles collision feedback, ghost preview, snap-to-slot. react-big-calendar requires manual react-dnd integration and has no snap.
2. **Time grid is the main view** for daily studio ops. FullCalendar's `timeGridDay` and `timeGridWeek` are the industry reference; react-big-calendar's time grid is notoriously buggy with overlapping events.
3. **`eventOverlap` callback** lets us prevent double-booking client-side before the API round-trip.
4. **Theming:** FullCalendar exposes CSS variables for every color, border, and background — maps cleanly to our `oklch` tokens. No hacking inline styles.
5. **Tested at scale:** Porter (our top competitor) uses it. We beat their UX by theming it to our dark system and adding the artist-color palette.

### Install

```bash
pnpm add @fullcalendar/react @fullcalendar/core @fullcalendar/daygrid \
         @fullcalendar/timegrid @fullcalendar/interaction @fullcalendar/list
```

`@fullcalendar/list` provides the agenda view for mobile auto-switch under `md`.

### FullCalendar theme override (add to `globals.css`)

```css
/* ── FullCalendar dark theme override ── */
:root {
  --fc-border-color: oklch(22% 0.02 264);
  --fc-daygrid-event-dot-width: 8px;
  --fc-today-bg-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.06);
  --fc-now-indicator-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292);
  --fc-non-business-color: oklch(14% 0.015 264 / 0.5);
  --fc-bg-event-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292);
  --fc-highlight-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.08);
  --fc-page-bg-color: transparent;
  --fc-neutral-bg-color: oklch(14% 0.015 264);
  --fc-neutral-text-color: oklch(65% 0.01 264);
  --fc-list-event-hover-bg-color: oklch(18% 0.02 264);
  --fc-small-font-size: 0.8em;
}
.fc .fc-toolbar-title {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.fc .fc-button {
  background: oklch(18% 0.02 264);
  border: 1px solid oklch(25% 0.02 264);
  color: oklch(70% 0.01 264);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem;
  transition: background 150ms ease-out, color 150ms ease-out;
}
.fc .fc-button:hover {
  background: oklch(24% 0.02 264);
  color: oklch(90% 0.01 264);
}
.fc .fc-button-primary:not(:disabled).fc-button-active {
  background: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.15);
  color: oklch(75% 0.18 292);
  border-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.3);
}
.fc-timegrid-slot {
  height: 2rem; /* 30-min slot height */
}
.fc-event {
  border-radius: 0.375rem;
  border-width: 0;
  border-left-width: 3px;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.fc-event-dragging {
  opacity: 0.75;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px oklch(0% 0 0 / 0.5);
}
.fc-event-selected {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px oklch(62% 0.24 292);
}
/* Hide default FullCalendar toolbar — we render our own */
.fc .fc-toolbar {
  display: none;
}
```

---

## 2. New Design Tokens — `app/globals.css`

Add to the `@theme inline` block after Sprint 1 tokens:

```css
/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   CALENDAR — artist color palette (10 artists max per view)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
--color-artist-1: oklch(62% 0.24 292);   /* electric purple — primary */
--color-artist-2: oklch(60% 0.22 230);   /* cobalt blue */
--color-artist-3: oklch(58% 0.2 160);    /* emerald */
--color-artist-4: oklch(62% 0.22 40);    /* amber-orange */
--color-artist-5: oklch(60% 0.24 340);   /* hot pink */
--color-artist-6: oklch(58% 0.2 200);    /* cyan */
--color-artist-7: oklch(60% 0.18 20);    /* coral red */
--color-artist-8: oklch(62% 0.16 280);   /* lavender */
--color-artist-9: oklch(58% 0.18 100);   /* yellow-green */
--color-artist-10: oklch(60% 0.2 260);   /* indigo */

/* Surface version (bg tint, 12% opacity) — used for event bg */
--color-artist-1-surface: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.12);
--color-artist-2-surface: oklch(60% 0.22 230 / 0.12);
/* (pattern continues for 3–10) */

/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   CALENDAR — structural
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
--calendar-slot-height: 2rem;          /* 30-min row */
--calendar-event-border-radius: 0.375rem;

/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   BOOKING FLOW (public pages)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
--booking-max-w: 44rem;                /* public booking page max width */
--color-booking-step-active: oklch(62% 0.24 292);
--color-booking-step-done: oklch(58% 0.18 145);
--color-booking-step-future: oklch(25% 0.02 264);

/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   APPOINTMENT DETAIL
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
--color-timeline-line: oklch(22% 0.02 264);
--color-timeline-dot-active: oklch(62% 0.24 292);
--color-timeline-dot-done: oklch(58% 0.18 145);
--color-timeline-dot-future: oklch(25% 0.02 264);

/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   DRAWER
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
--animate-sheet-in: sheet-slide-in 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
@keyframes sheet-slide-in {
  from { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; }
  to   { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
}
```

Add to `@layer components`:

```css
/* ── Artist event colors (FullCalendar events) ── */
.artist-event-1 { border-left-color: var(--color-artist-1); background: var(--color-artist-1-surface); color: var(--color-artist-1); }
.artist-event-2 { border-left-color: var(--color-artist-2); background: var(--color-artist-2-surface); color: var(--color-artist-2); }
/* ... pattern for 3–10 */

/* ── Appointment timeline ── */
.timeline-step-done   { --dot-bg: var(--color-timeline-dot-done);   --dot-border: transparent; }
.timeline-step-active { --dot-bg: var(--color-timeline-dot-active); --dot-border: transparent; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--color-timeline-dot-active); }
.timeline-step-future { --dot-bg: transparent; --dot-border: var(--color-timeline-line); }

/* ── Booking page trust elements ── */
.booking-service-card {
  transition: box-shadow 150ms ease-out, border-color 150ms ease-out;
}
.booking-service-card:hover {
  border-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.4);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.15);
}
.booking-service-card[data-selected="true"] {
  border-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.6);
  background: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.06);
}

/* ── Slot picker ── */
.time-slot {
  transition: background 100ms ease-out, color 100ms ease-out, border-color 100ms ease-out;
}
.time-slot:hover:not([data-disabled]) {
  background: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.1);
  border-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.3);
}
.time-slot[data-selected="true"] {
  background: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.15);
  border-color: oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.6);
  color: oklch(75% 0.18 292);
}
.time-slot[data-disabled="true"] {
  opacity: 0.35;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}
```

---

## 3. Component Inventory

### New shadcn installs

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add sheet
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add table
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add checkbox
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add popover
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add calendar       # shadcn date picker — for date range filter
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add date-picker    # if available, else compose manually
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add textarea
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add tabs
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add alert
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add alert-dialog
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add command
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add scroll-area
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add radio-group
```

### Custom components to create (Sprint 2)

| Path | Purpose | Server/Client | Notes |
|------|---------|---------------|-------|
| `components/calendar/CalendarView.tsx` | FullCalendar wrapper — day/week/month/list | Client | Owns all FC config |
| `components/calendar/CalendarToolbar.tsx` | Custom toolbar: nav + view switcher + filters | Client | Replaces FC built-in toolbar |
| `components/calendar/ArtistFilter.tsx` | Multi-select artist color chips filter | Client | — |
| `components/calendar/LocationFilter.tsx` | Location select (shown when >1 location) | Client | Conditionally rendered |
| `components/calendar/StatusFilter.tsx` | Status filter chips | Client | — |
| `components/calendar/CalendarEmptyState.tsx` | Two variants: new-studio + filtered-out | Server | — |
| `components/appointments/AppointmentDrawer.tsx` | Sheet slide-in, shared for create + edit | Client | Step machine for create, direct form for edit |
| `components/appointments/AppointmentCard.tsx` | Single appointment row in calendar event | Client | Compact: client, service, time |
| `components/appointments/AppointmentStatusBadge.tsx` | Extends Sprint 1 StatusBadge with dot + label | Server | — |
| `components/appointments/AppointmentTimeline.tsx` | Status lifecycle visual timeline | Client | Renders allowed transitions |
| `components/appointments/PhotoGallery.tsx` | Before/during/after image gallery with upload | Client | Signed URLs, drag+drop upload |
| `components/appointments/SessionNotes.tsx` | Rich text notes with autosave | Client | Debounced 800ms |
| `components/appointments/DepositStatus.tsx` | Deposit/payment state display | Client | Stub for Sprint 4 |
| `components/waitlist/WaitlistTable.tsx` | Simple list with offer-slot CTA | Client | — |
| `components/booking/BookingStepIndicator.tsx` | Progress bar for new-appt flow | Client | Local step state |
| `components/booking/ServicePicker.tsx` | Service card grid for booking step 1 | Client | Used in both internal drawer and public flow |
| `components/booking/ArtistPicker.tsx` | Artist avatar row for booking step 2 | Client | — |
| `components/booking/SlotPicker.tsx` | Time slot grid for booking step 3 | Client | Calls availability API |
| `components/booking/ClientFinder.tsx` | Search existing client or create new | Client | Combobox with create option |
| `components/booking-page/BookingPageSettings.tsx` | Settings page editor + preview | Client | — |
| `components/booking-page/BookingPagePreview.tsx` | Iframe or simulated preview | Client | Sandboxed preview |
| `app/book/[studioSlug]/_components/PublicBookingLayout.tsx` | No sidebar, studio-branded header | Server | — |
| `app/book/[studioSlug]/_components/StudioHero.tsx` | Studio logo + cover + bio + CTA | Server | — |
| `app/book/[studioSlug]/_components/PublicServiceCard.tsx` | Service display card (public) | Server | — |
| `app/book/[studioSlug]/_components/ArtistRosterChips.tsx` | Artist avatar chips | Server | — |
| `app/book/[studioSlug]/[serviceId]/_components/BookingForm.tsx` | Full booking form with steps | Client | — |
| `app/book/[studioSlug]/confirmation/[token]/_components/ConfirmationCard.tsx` | Booking confirmed view | Server | — |

---

## 4. Calendar Page — `/calendar`

### 4a. Layout

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ AppHeader (sticky h-14)                                          │
├─────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ AppSidebar      │ SidebarInset                                   │
│ (Sprint 1)      │                                                │
│                 │  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│                 │  │  CalendarToolbar (h-14 sticky top-14)    │  │
│                 │  │  ← Prev  [Today]  Next →   | Week ▾ |   │  │
│                 │  │  Mon Apr 14 – Sun Apr 20   |[+ New] |   │  │
│                 │  └──────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
│                 │                                                │
│                 │  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│                 │  │  Filters row (h-10, below toolbar)       │  │
│                 │  │  [All Artists ▾] [All Locations ▾]       │  │
│                 │  │  [All Statuses ▾]                        │  │
│                 │  └──────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
│                 │                                                │
│                 │  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│                 │  │  CalendarView (FullCalendar)              │  │
│                 │  │  fills remaining viewport height         │  │
│                 │  │  overflow: hidden (FC handles scroll)    │  │
│                 │  └──────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
│                 │                                                │
│                 │  AppointmentDrawer (Sheet, z-50)              │
└─────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Page wrapper:** `flex flex-col h-svh overflow-hidden`
**SidebarInset content:** `flex flex-col flex-1 overflow-hidden`
**FullCalendar container:** `flex-1 overflow-hidden px-4 pb-4`

### 4b. CalendarToolbar component

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  [ChevronLeft h-4 w-4]  [Today]  [ChevronRight h-4 w-4]        │  ← navigation cluster
│                                                                  │
│  Mon Apr 14 – Sun Apr 20, 2026            [Week ▾]  [+ New]    │  ← tabular-nums date
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Desktop (lg+): single row, space-between
Mobile (<md): two rows — nav row then title+actions row
```

**View selector DropdownMenu:**
- Options: Day / Week / Month — `RadioGroup` inside Popover
- Default: Week (stored in `localStorage` key `inkos-calendar-view`)
- Icons: `CalendarDays` (day), `CalendarRange` (week), `Calendar` (month), `List` (agenda — shown only on mobile)

**"+ New" button:** `Button variant="default" size="sm"` opens `AppointmentDrawer` in create mode with no preselection.

**Classes:**
```
toolbar: flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 h-14 border-b border-border/40 bg-background sticky top-14 z-30
nav-cluster: flex items-center gap-1
today-btn: Button variant="outline" size="sm" h-8 text-xs
nav-btn: Button variant="ghost" size="icon" h-8 w-8
title: text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-foreground
view-btn: Button variant="outline" size="sm" h-8 text-xs gap-1.5
new-btn: Button variant="default" size="sm" h-8 text-xs gap-1.5
```

### 4c. Filters row

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  [Users2 h-3.5 w-3.5] All Artists ▾     [MapPin] Studio A ▾    │
│  [Circle] All Statuses ▾                                        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

filters-row: flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 border-b border-border/30
filter-trigger: Button variant="ghost" size="sm" h-8 text-xs gap-1.5 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground
active-filter: text-foreground bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20
```

**Artist filter dropdown (Popover + Command):**
- "All Artists" option at top (radio-style, clears multi-select)
- Each artist: avatar chip (24px) + name + color swatch dot matching their calendar color
- Selected artists: color chip row replaces "All Artists ▾" label
- Max 3 shown inline, overflow as "+N more"

**Status filter (Popover + Checkboxes):**
- Options: Confirmed, In Progress, Completed, Cancelled, No Show, Pending
- Each with `StatusBadge` dot indicator

**Location filter:** Only rendered when `locations.length > 1`. Simple `Select`.

### 4d. FullCalendar configuration

```typescript
// CalendarView.tsx — FullCalendar props
const calendarOptions = {
  plugins: [dayGridPlugin, timeGridPlugin, interactionPlugin, listPlugin],
  initialView: 'timeGridWeek',            // default
  headerToolbar: false,                   // we render our own CalendarToolbar
  editable: true,                         // enables drag-drop
  droppable: false,                       // no external drops
  selectable: true,                       // click empty slot → create booking
  selectMirror: true,
  nowIndicator: true,
  allDaySlot: false,                      // tattoo studios have no all-day events
  slotDuration: '00:30:00',
  slotMinTime: '08:00:00',
  slotMaxTime: '22:00:00',
  expandRows: true,
  stickyHeaderDates: true,
  dayMaxEvents: 3,                        // month view — "+N more" overflow
  businessHours: {
    daysOfWeek: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6],      // Mon–Sat (Sun off by default)
    startTime: '10:00',
    endTime: '20:00',
  },
  eventOverlap: (stillEvent, movingEvent) => {
    // Different artists can overlap on same day column — only block same artist
    return stillEvent.extendedProps.artistId !== movingEvent.extendedProps.artistId;
  },
  eventContent: (arg) => <AppointmentCard event={arg.event} />,
  select: (info) => openCreateDrawer({ start: info.start, end: info.end }),
  eventClick: (info) => openEditDrawer(info.event.extendedProps.appointmentId),
  eventDrop: (info) => handleReschedule(info),
  eventResize: (info) => handleReschedule(info),
}
```

### 4e. CalendarView — responsive behavior

| Breakpoint | View | Drag-drop | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `xl` (1280px+) | Week (default) | Full drag-drop | Primary work surface |
| `lg` (1024px) | Week | Full drag-drop | Sidebar narrower |
| `md` (768px) | Day | Full drag-drop | Week too compressed |
| `< md` | Agenda List | Disabled — tap to reschedule | Touch-safe |

Auto-switch logic:
```typescript
// In CalendarView.tsx
const { width } = useWindowSize()
const view = useMemo(() => {
  if (savedView) return savedView    // user preference overrides
  if (width < 768) return 'listWeek'
  if (width < 1024) return 'timeGridDay'
  return 'timeGridWeek'
}, [width, savedView])
```

Mobile tap-to-reschedule: on `eventClick` in list view, show `AlertDialog` with "Move this appointment?" + date/time picker — no drag-drop on touch.

