## 7. Appointment Status Lifecycle

### State machine

```
                    ┌──────────┐
                    │  PENDING │
                    └────┬─────┘
                         │ confirm()
                    ┌────▼─────┐
                    │CONFIRMED │◄─── (can also cancel or no_show)
                    └────┬─────┘
                         │ start_session()
               ┌─────────▼─────────┐
               │   IN_PROGRESS     │
               └─────────┬─────────┘
                          │ mark_complete()   (triggers commission record)
               ┌──────────▼──────────┐
               │    COMPLETED        │  ← terminal
               └─────────────────────┘

CANCELLED  ← from pending or confirmed only (not in_progress)
NO_SHOW    ← from pending or confirmed only
```

### Allowed transitions table

| From | Allowed next states |
|---|---|
| `pending` | `confirmed`, `cancelled`, `no_show` |
| `confirmed` | `in_progress`, `cancelled`, `no_show` |
| `in_progress` | `completed` only |
| `completed` | — (terminal) |
| `cancelled` | — (terminal) |
| `no_show` | — (terminal) |

### UI affordances per transition

| Transition | Button | Dialog? | Toast |
|---|---|---|---|
| `pending → confirmed` | `[Confirm appointment]` primary | No | `"Appointment confirmed"` |
| `confirmed → in_progress` | `[Start session]` primary | No | `"Session started"` |
| `in_progress → completed` | `[Mark complete →]` primary | Yes — "This will calculate the commission. Confirm?" + `[Cancel] [Mark complete]` | `"Session complete — commission recorded"` |
| `* → cancelled` | `[Cancel appointment]` ghost destructive | Yes — reason select (reason: no_show / client_cancelled / studio_cancelled / other) | `"Appointment cancelled"` |
| `* → no_show` | `[Mark no-show]` ghost destructive | Yes — "Client did not arrive. Mark as no-show?" | `"Marked as no-show"` |

Cancel reasons stored in `bookings.cancellation_reason` (add to migration).

### Status badge component spec

`components/appointments/AppointmentStatusBadge.tsx` — extends `StatusBadge` from Sprint 1:

```tsx
interface AppointmentStatusBadgeProps {
  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'in_progress' | 'completed' | 'cancelled' | 'no_show'
  size?: 'sm' | 'default'
  showDot?: boolean   // adds 6px color dot before label
}
```

| Status | Label | Class | Dot color |
