| `pending` | Pending | `badge-pending` | `--color-status-pending` (amber) |
| `confirmed` | Confirmed | `badge-confirmed` | `--color-status-confirmed` (purple) |
| `in_progress` | In Progress | `badge-in-progress` | `--color-status-in-progress` (cyan) — pulsing |
| `completed` | Completed | `badge-completed` | `--color-status-completed` (emerald) |
| `cancelled` | Cancelled | `badge-cancelled` | `--color-status-cancelled` (muted) |
| `no_show` | No Show | `badge-no-show` | `--color-status-no-show` (red) |

