## 13. Toast Messages — Complete Mutation Map

All toasts use Sonner (`sonner` package from Sprint 1 scaffold). `toast.loading` returns an ID for later `toast.dismiss(id)`.

### Calendar

| Mutation | Toast |
|---|---|
| Create appointment success | `toast.success("Appointment created", { description: clientName + " · " + dateStr })` |
| Create appointment error | `toast.error("Couldn't create appointment", { description: error.message })` |
| Reschedule success | `toast.success("Appointment moved", { description: newDateStr })` |
| Reschedule error (API) | `toast.error("Couldn't reschedule", { description: error.message })` |
| Reschedule error (collision) | No toast — FullCalendar visual handles it |
| Loading fetch | No toast — skeleton handles it |

### Appointment status transitions

| Mutation | Toast |
|---|---|
| `pending → confirmed` | `toast.success("Appointment confirmed")` |
| `confirmed → in_progress` | `toast.success("Session started")` |
| `in_progress → completed` | `toast.success("Session complete — commission pending")` |
| `* → cancelled` | `toast.success("Appointment cancelled")` |
| `* → no_show` | `toast.success("Marked as no-show")` |
| Any transition error | `toast.error("Status update failed", { description: error.message })` |

### Appointments table

| Mutation | Toast |
|---|---|
| Bulk confirm | `toast.success("3 appointments confirmed")` (N = count) |
| Bulk cancel | `toast.success("3 appointments cancelled")` |
| Export CSV start | `toast.loading("Preparing export...", { id: 'export' })` |
| Export CSV ready | `toast.success("Export ready", { id: 'export', description: "Downloading..." })` |
| Export CSV error | `toast.error("Export failed", { id: 'export' })` |
| Row delete | `toast.success("Appointment removed")` with Undo button (5s, soft-delete on server) |

### Appointment detail

| Mutation | Toast |
|---|---|
| Notes autosave success | No toast — inline "Saved" indicator in note header |
| Notes autosave error | `toast.error("Note couldn't save — retrying")` |
| Photo upload start | `toast.loading("Uploading photo...")` |
| Photo upload success | `toast.success("Photo added")` |
| Photo upload error (MIME) | `toast.error("Only JPG, PNG, or WebP photos")` |
| Photo upload error (size) | `toast.error("Photo must be under 10 MB")` |
| Photo upload error (API) | `toast.error("Upload failed — try again")` |
| Photo delete | `toast.success("Photo removed")` |

### Waitlist

| Mutation | Toast |
|---|---|
| Offer slot success | `toast.success("Slot offered", { description: clientName + " notified via SMS" })` |
| Offer slot error | `toast.error("Couldn't send offer — " + error.message)` |
| Add to waitlist | `toast.success("Added to waitlist")` |
| Remove from waitlist | `toast.success("Removed from waitlist")` |

### Booking page settings

| Mutation | Toast |
|---|---|
| Save settings success | `toast.success("Booking page updated")` |
| Save settings error | `toast.error("Couldn't save — " + error.message)` |
| Cover image upload success | `toast.success("Cover image updated")` |
| Cover image upload error | `toast.error("Image upload failed")` |

